{"id":13613,"artist":"from 'Jesus Christ Superstar'","title":"I don't Know How to Love Him","lyrics_plain":"(MARY)I don't know how to love him\nWhat to do how to move him\nI've been changed yes really changed\nIn these past few days\nWhen I've seen myself\nI seem like someone else\nI don't know how to take this\nI don't see why he moves me\nHe's a man\nHe's just a man\nAnd I've had so many\nMen before\nIn very many ways\nHe's just one more\nShould I bring him down\nShould I scream and shout\nShould I speak of love\nLet my feelings out?\nI never thought I'd come to this\nWhat's it all about?\nDon't you think it's rather funny\nI should be in this position?\nI'm the one\nWho's always been\nSo calm so cool\nNo lover's fool\nRunning every show\nHe scares me so\nShould I bring him down\nShould I scream and shout\nShould I speak of love\nLet my feelings out?\nI never thought I'd come to this\nWhat's it all about?\nYet if he said he loved me\nI'd be lost\nI'd be frightened\nI couldn't cope\nJust couldn't cope\nI'd turn my head\nI'd back away\nI wouldn't want to know\nHe scares me so\nI want him so\nI love him so","lyrics_synced":"[00:07.06] (MARY)I don't know how to love him\n[00:15.00] What to do how to move him\n[00:20.29] I've been changed yes really changed\n[00:27.35] In these past few days\n[00:31.10] When I've seen myself\n[00:34.85] I seem like someone else\n[00:42.35] I don't know how to take this\n[00:50.29] I don't see why he moves me\n[00:55.59] He's a man\n[00:58.68] He's just a man\n[01:02.65] And I've had so many\n[01:07.06] Men before\n[01:10.15] In very many ways\n[01:16.32] He's just one more\n[01:22.06] Should I bring him down\n[01:25.59] Should I scream and shout\n[01:29.12] Should I speak of love\n[01:32.65] Let my feelings out?\n[01:35.74] I never thought I'd come to this\n[01:42.35] What's it all about?\n[01:52.94] Don't you think it's rather funny\n[02:00.88] I should be in this position?\n[02:06.18] I'm the one\n[02:09.26] Who's always been\n[02:13.68] So calm so cool\n[02:18.09] No lover's fool\n[02:21.18] Running every show\n[02:26.91] He scares me so\n[02:32.65] Should I bring him down\n[02:36.18] Should I scream and shout\n[02:39.71] Should I speak of love\n[02:43.24] Let my feelings out?\n[02:46.32] I never thought I'd come to this\n[02:52.94] What's it all about?\n[03:03.53] Yet if he said he loved me\n[03:11.47] I'd be lost\n[03:13.24] I'd be frightened\n[03:16.32] I couldn't cope\n[03:19.85] Just couldn't cope\n[03:24.26] I'd turn my head\n[03:28.68] I'd back away\n[03:31.32] I wouldn't want to know\n[03:37.50] He scares me so\n[03:41.03] I want him so\n[03:44.56] I love him so","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:07.05] <00:07.05>I <00:08.82>don't <00:09.26>know <00:09.70>how <00:10.14>to <00:10.58>love <00:12.35>him\n[00:14.99] <00:14.99>What <00:15.44>to <00:15.88>do, <00:16.76>how <00:17.20>to <00:17.64>move <00:19.41>him\n[00:20.29] <00:20.29>I've <00:20.73>been <00:21.17>changed, <00:23.38>yes <00:23.82>real <00:24.26>ly <00:24.70>changed\n[00:27.35] <00:27.35>In <00:27.79>these <00:28.23>past <00:29.55>few <00:29.99>days\n[00:31.10] <00:31.10>When <00:31.32>I've <00:31.76>seen <00:33.08>my <00:33.52>self\n[00:34.85] <00:34.85>I <00:35.29>seem <00:36.17>like <00:37.05>so <00:37.94>meone <00:38.82>else\n[00:42.35] <00:42.35>I <00:44.11>don't <00:44.55>know <00:44.99>how <00:45.44>to <00:45.88>take <00:47.64>this\n[00:50.29] <00:50.29>I <00:50.73>don't <00:51.17>see <00:52.05>why <00:52.49>he <00:52.94>moves <00:54.70>me\n[00:55.58] <00:55.58>He's <00:56.02>a <00:56.47>man\n[00:58.67] <00:58.67>He's <00:59.11>just <00:59.55>a <00:59.99>man\n[01:02.64] <01:02.64>And <01:03.08>I've <01:03.52>had <01:04.85>so <01:05.29>ma <01:06.17>ny\n[01:07.05] <01:07.05>Men <01:08.38>be <01:08.82>fore\n[01:10.14] <01:10.14>In <01:10.58>ve <01:11.47>ry <01:12.35>ma <01:13.23>ny <01:14.11>ways\n[01:16.32] <01:16.32>He's <01:16.76>just <01:17.20>one <01:17.64>more\n[01:22.05] <01:22.05>Should <01:22.49>I <01:22.94>bring <0